msgid ". _common-rangefinder-gy-us42:"
msgstr ". _common-rangefinder-gy-us42:"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:5
#: 686d2a75644b4bb5baa93a71a5555ab9
msgid "GY-US42v2 Sonar"
msgstr "GY-US42v2 声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:9
#: 3b8f937e70164098896e546c8bf7763a
msgid ""
"The GY-US042v2 Sonar is a very inexpensive, short range (up to 4m) range "
"finder primarily designed for indoor use but which has been successfully "
"used outdoors on Copter. It does provide more consistent height control "
"below 4m than many barometers."
msgstr ""
"GY-US042v2 声呐是一款非常便宜的短程（最远 4m）测距仪，主要设计用于室内，但也已成功用于 Copter 的室外场景。它能在 4m "
"以下提供比许多气压计更稳定的高度控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:11
#: e395ce3411da423da990a75ce9cf5a40
msgid ""
"This sensor is similar to the :ref:`common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c`, but has"
" the ability to operate in serial and triggered pulse modes (similar to "
":ref:`common-rangefinder-hcsr04`) in addition to i2c."
msgstr ""
"此传感器与 :ref:`common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c` 类似，但除 I2C 外，还支持串口和触发脉冲模式（类似 "
":ref:`common-rangefinder-hcsr04`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:13
#: 021d030d54b14656a32e04c8b11e670c
msgid ""
"For I2C mode, set the :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “2\" and no "
"bridging of the three solder pads is required."
msgstr "I2C 模式下，设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「2」，无需桥接三个焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:15
#: 952d90dff4f84f1ea5b17b07062e6daa
msgid ""
"For Triggered Pulse mode, tie the center pad to \"L\" and set the "
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “30\"."
msgstr "触发脉冲模式下，将中间焊盘连接到「L」，并设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「30」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:17
#: 29bc1dae96e042e5b765e054dcc476e5
msgid ""
"For Serial Mode, tie the center pad to \"H\" and set  "
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “31\". And set the Serial Port used to "
"communicate with it to ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = \"9\" (Rangefinder) and "
"``SERIALx_BAUD`` = 9 (9600)."
msgstr ""
"串口模式下，将中间焊盘连接到「H」，并设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「31」。将与其通信的串口设置为 "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 「9」（测距仪）和 ``SERIALx_BAUD`` = 9（9600）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:19
#: 1c1551180d0642d6aa2ce3f0554ea228
msgid ""
"This device has a maximum useful range of 4m, so set -  "
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = \"4\"."
msgstr "此设备最大有效量程为 4m，因此设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:21
#: ccae108c19174c29b58b03fbe091279a
msgid "Pinout:"
msgstr "引脚定义："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:23
#: 9a0d1965349f4e31b99f19be6c469293
msgid "\"CR\" pin is either the SCL (I2C mode), Serial RX, or Trigger input"
msgstr "「CR」引脚可为 SCL（I2C 模式）、串口 RX 或触发输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-gy-us42.rst:24
#: fc59c2e474dc49eaa559460f5064e9a3
msgid "\"DT\" pin is either the  SDA (I2C mode), Serail TX, or Echo output"
msgstr "「DT」引脚可为 SDA（I2C 模式）、串口 TX 或回波输出"
